  "dataset_id": "ztf-dr24-searched-field-nulls-v3",
  "created_at_utc": "2026-07-21T00:00:00+00:00",
  "purpose": "Leakage-safe real searched-field null outcomes for transparent field-ranking calibration and audit. v2 adds a predeclared, stratified (top/middle/bottom/random) sample to reduce the top-ranked-only selection bias flagged in v1's interpretation_limits. v3 adds 4 more bottom-stratum fields closing the gap left by v2's one genuine acquisition failure, reaching the >=20-per-mode Aten threshold.",
  "outcome_definition": "A bounded ZTF DR24 search with at least three populated observation nights produced no candidate surviving the applicable production association and review path.",
  "interpretation_limits": [
    "A null_result is a bounded search outcome, not evidence that no NEO was present in the field.",
    "Entries 1-9 (v1) were selected for search and are not a random or bottom-ranked control sample.",
    "Entries 10-20 (v2 addendum) are a predeclared, stratified top/middle/bottom/random sample -- see selection_stratum on each entry and data_selection/calibration/stratified_control_targets_v1.json for the exact predeclaration.",
    "This dataset can measure review burden and retrospective ranking behavior but cannot alone identify causal discovery-yield weights.",
    "Entries 21-24 (v3 addendum) are a second predeclared bottom-stratum batch closing the 17/20 gap left after v2's one acquisition failure -- see selection_stratum on each entry and data_selection/calibration/stratified_control_targets_v2.json for the exact predeclaration."
